<meta name='description' content='Federal procurement tribunals are increasingly identifying misuse of generative AI in bid protests and contract disputes. This analysis reviews 2025 decisions from GAO, COFC, and boards of contract appeals, outlines common hallmarks of AI misuse, and examines emerging risks, warnings, and sanctions facing contractors.' />
