<li><div class='title'><a href='/government-contracting/author/david-timm'>David P. J. Timm</a></div><div class='photo'><a href='/government-contracting/author/david-timm'><picture >
						<source srcset='/government-contracting/assets/images-t1790966675/7995_directory.webp' type='image/webp'>
						<img alt='Photo of David P. J. Timm' src='/government-contracting/assets/images-t1790966675/7995_directory.webp' />
					</picture></a></div><div class='bioposition'>Partner</div><div class='contact'><span class='email'><a href='&#109;&#97;&#105;&#108;&#116;&#111;&#58;&#100;&#116;&#105;&#109;&#109;&#64;&#98;&#117;&#114;&#114;&#46;&#99;&#111;&#109;'>Email</a></span> | <span class='phone'><a href='tel:(771) 232-1696'>(771) 232-1696</a></span></div><div class='abstract'><p>David P.J. Timm represents government contractors in high-stakes bid protests and claims against federal agencies. He Chairs the Bid Protest Committee for the Federal Bar Association and publishes and presents on bid protest&nbsp;... </p></div><div class='links'><span class='viewProfile'><a target=_blank href='https://www.burr.com/people/david-timm'>Full Bio</a></span> | <span class='contactAuthor'><a href='&#109;&#97;&#105;&#108;&#116;&#111;&#58;&#100;&#116;&#105;&#109;&#109;&#64;&#98;&#117;&#114;&#114;&#46;&#99;&#111;&#109;'>Contact Author</a></span> | <span class='linkedIn'><a target=_blank href='https://www.linkedin.com/in/timmdavid/'>LinkedIn</a></span> | <span class='viewPosts'><a href='/government-contracting/author/david-timm'>Blog Posts</a></span></div></li>
