				</main>
				
				<div id='subContent'>
				
			<!--UDMCOMMENT-->
			<p>Federal, state, and local governments spend billions of dollars each year on goods and services for their citizens. Our federal government contracts team has a 25-year track record of helping businesses solve problems and achieve their goals in the areas of construction and government contracts.<span> Here, they share their insights as well as important updates.</span></p>

			
